title: "NetBox MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server for NetBox (DCIM/IPAM): generic tools for every object type, search, change log, GraphQL, IP/prefix/VLAN/ASN allocation, cable tracing, config rendering, plugin discovery and optional netbox-branching. Read-only and dry-run modes."
